  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "剛剛下過雨，我們踩着積水的街道，在中央大街上游走，究竟是去江邊，還是去其他地方呢？",
      "output_sha256": "4cfda0c9b9baf2065200c41c4ba0f0fd9dffb9ccaf6e84ee318aa3a6ec0eb604",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": 0.598333,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        1,
        2
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6be72def1f2cf4990bd752f640fdd4f5e9025d244a11c5f5840774bf080e6c67",
        "198a0a46035db03e9197cc68d75e91e76e10ec74209b52e6907f8b520b4c9b71"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_ai_sha256": "4cfda0c9b9baf2065200c41c4ba0f0fd9dffb9ccaf6e84ee318aa3a6ec0eb604",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "天空的雲還沒有散，街頭的行人還是那樣稀疏，任意走，但是再不能走了。",
      "output_sha256": "dbc4a2bf350d766b09f480cb0fcfee1ab7d5c585dae6cc8a605ef07b2875f4d2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "dbc4a2bf350d766b09f480cb0fcfee1ab7d5c585dae6cc8a605ef07b2875f4d2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“郎華，我們應該定個日子，什麼時候出發呢？”",
      "output_sha256": "bad44e0921a151fb5d69ba3d4d132291991a4b28f829bedf7ed3dbf0b0162595",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": 0.619936,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "16882c02c616bb629489edbe1e4894a979ab6d71fb07eb7c013216c803d97730"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_ai_sha256": "bad44e0921a151fb5d69ba3d4d132291991a4b28f829bedf7ed3dbf0b0162595",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“現在三號，十三號吧！",
      "output_sha256": "6cffe741dc191122495700e4b9314e12c54cd33a76fff05f095f02e44f40a000",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "6cffe741dc191122495700e4b9314e12c54cd33a76fff05f095f02e44f40a000",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "還有十天，怎麼樣？”",
      "output_sha256": "728f8dfebffddf8ccedcd7b9842e88f72ef56c0ccc4360c0db2416458709690e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "728f8dfebffddf8ccedcd7b9842e88f72ef56c0ccc4360c0db2416458709690e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我突然停下來，驚覺哈爾濱即將與我們告別！",
      "output_sha256": "fd824645fd4a33fc30c62fce1aa816c2d233d8800ec16150118a367e8a0f8fe0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": 0.525526,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a6c271d90d0cb9eff17b8886f8e6e51f7d64914d8f3f2aabb849fe1627f49b9e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_ai_sha256": "fd824645fd4a33fc30c62fce1aa816c2d233d8800ec16150118a367e8a0f8fe0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "還有十天，十天以後的日子，我們要過在車上，海上，看不見松花江了，只要“滿洲國”存在一天，我們是不能來到這塊土地。",
      "output_sha256": "c37a784761692b7f9df643f267e5b717238424adf5363b1e6fa6828c630f0113",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "c37a784761692b7f9df643f267e5b717238424adf5363b1e6fa6828c630f0113",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "李和陳成也來了，似乎我們的離去是注定的。",
      "output_sha256": "46d67a083a39d7996477679fa3a6643912c7311ad53067028fc2b3ba277dd2f6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": 0.551484,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e0fbfef192a6125ba34cb0aa50abfa38bca828ed28fae9890131cf3376d8638d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_ai_sha256": "46d67a083a39d7996477679fa3a6643912c7311ad53067028fc2b3ba277dd2f6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“還有七天，走了好啊！”",
      "output_sha256": "5ec9e1c2f1c37cb397db1df802a3822b3d262643cde606db344fffcfc91421af",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "5ec9e1c2f1c37cb397db1df802a3822b3d262643cde606db344fffcfc91421af",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "陳成說。",
      "output_sha256": "bda10f11a08ecfda71032a98f8ba1fdde40d365a985a8cb9fb6d67501d789d39",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "bda10f11a08ecfda71032a98f8ba1fdde40d365a985a8cb9fb6d67501d789d39",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "爲着我們走，老張請我們吃飯。",
      "output_sha256": "ff438178b6a857c34b98b83090e4acb01698d298a38a21f979fbecdbe5d71aa3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "ff438178b6a857c34b98b83090e4acb01698d298a38a21f979fbecdbe5d71aa3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "吃過飯以後，又去逛公園。",
      "output_sha256": "540e1cb7569581e14bec0a127587c998588c462d2df9d3e9f740db4df34f1b61",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "540e1cb7569581e14bec0a127587c998588c462d2df9d3e9f740db4df34f1b61",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在公園又吃冰激凌，無論怎樣總感到另一種滋味，公園的大樹，公園夏日的風，沙土，花草，水池，假山，山頂的涼亭……這一切和往日兩樣，我沒有像往日那樣到公園裏亂跑，我是安靜靜地走，腳下的沙土慢慢地在響。",
      "output_sha256": "54bd9b9c91771dd0393688c625b3993860aeae67e4e1bcc460947a1dae2bc757",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "54bd9b9c91771dd0393688c625b3993860aeae67e4e1bcc460947a1dae2bc757",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "夜晚屋中又剩了我一個人，郎華的學生跑到窗前。",
      "output_sha256": "59f82254dce131ff359059280f297551da424a9768dd26a2ab2fac45fa0f1123",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "59f82254dce131ff359059280f297551da424a9768dd26a2ab2fac45fa0f1123",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他偷偷觀察着我，他在窗前走來走去，假裝着閒走來觀察我，來觀察這屋中的事情，觀察不足，於是問了：",
      "output_sha256": "bc46c0494a2a3701b9d842dc2e2d522b0e4cb5361575aa88e008a33f9e9b6e81",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "bc46c0494a2a3701b9d842dc2e2d522b0e4cb5361575aa88e008a33f9e9b6e81",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“我老師去哪裡了？”",
      "output_sha256": "4f71a3fbad5e1ea22871546549c2cc27fff390a5f5cc923220201d5b3ba88c2f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": 0.554545,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "77b565d5ab741fcbcf4cc05491400851d2d96c5594d3cf877fad1de65ba7acca"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_ai_sha256": "4f71a3fbad5e1ea22871546549c2cc27fff390a5f5cc923220201d5b3ba88c2f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        18
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“找他做什麼？”",
      "output_sha256": "9dc0e2eca0d30fee9c61c6c28f1a655b1652d8417adf64327e94e3bbf97fc3ba",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "9dc0e2eca0d30fee9c61c6c28f1a655b1652d8417adf64327e94e3bbf97fc3ba",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“找我老師上課。”",
      "output_sha256": "90254ae2ca59f66641d89dbd46e221f71b483522e6b6b782356d778656123ec4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "90254ae2ca59f66641d89dbd46e221f71b483522e6b6b782356d778656123ec4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "其實那孩子平日就不願意上課，他覺得老師這屋有個景況：怎麼這些日子賣起東西來，舊棉花，破皮褥子……",
      "output_sha256": "cf5be21d96acc0fdd262a8e9b939f55487e64ab0ff25db5478e27289a8089dcc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "cf5be21d96acc0fdd262a8e9b939f55487e64ab0ff25db5478e27289a8089dcc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "要搬家吧？",
      "output_sha256": "3a64dba46b9e12e4371dcdf23cfdfca43a61dfc8e82a9f5722b71a1faf8beb7d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "3a64dba46b9e12e4371dcdf23cfdfca43a61dfc8e82a9f5722b71a1faf8beb7d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "那孩子心中無法確定究竟發生了什麼。",
      "output_sha256": "fb33f3db5d07e14376052df85e5c5053fd6d1e8e7975616ac30db8c14ae7eb72",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": 0.406988,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "19015169ffff775345e399876f1ea133f79f6d1c62c77e27a53b5400f2c08429"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_ai_sha256": "fb33f3db5d07e14376052df85e5c5053fd6d1e8e7975616ac30db8c14ae7eb72",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他跑回去又把小菊找來，這女孩和他一般大，當然也察覺到不尋常。",
      "output_sha256": "f3f26bcb89be16bcc9298395077b9cfda017c563fb57b995524cf738c3431901",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": 0.645056,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5d5760f0a256f15ead6a9b6ab068b9e1a8cec594f0fd483359a76ccb655c7d12"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f3f26bcb89be16bcc9298395077b9cfda017c563fb57b995524cf738c3431901",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我把燈閉上了，要收拾的東西，暫時也不收拾了！",
      "output_sha256": "b1af5c653531efa4442b2bd936e26ec6af797c3a72752a3a4b0400da708150aa",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "b1af5c653531efa4442b2bd936e26ec6af797c3a72752a3a4b0400da708150aa",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "躺在床上，輕觸著牆壁，又摸摸床邊，現在這一切仍是我熟悉的，然而再過七天，這些都將不再屬於我。",
      "output_sha256": "7ca07e54c0d772275a0731d7375652a1d048641519fd234b860d4a4907bc58d5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": 0.542925,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7852ba903cd56b8241d14bdb73ab3313617ef12a2d07916d032c62bb3b8371ae"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_ai_sha256": "7ca07e54c0d772275a0731d7375652a1d048641519fd234b860d4a4907bc58d5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "小鍋、小水壺終會被舊貨商人提走，伴隨着響聲與光芒，離開我的視線！",
      "output_sha256": "306a53b97a63dd7f549518b12c668e22f7877ba66d90642bc64c09ae5863607e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": 0.534943,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "cb935d5e9ab22612b69c0d36fa9cffdd45be2895fc617e0410befd5172ab2e1e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_ai_sha256": "306a53b97a63dd7f549518b12c668e22f7877ba66d90642bc64c09ae5863607e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "那是前年冬天，郎華從破爛市買回來的。",
      "output_sha256": "8eea218955322ece32a3ab71853d9a14924b311e54b54b92a94650e904041a63",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "8eea218955322ece32a3ab71853d9a14924b311e54b54b92a94650e904041a63",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "現在又將回到破爛市去。",
      "output_sha256": "c63872917723db1d54264e82fd3f553ba01fafeab62afb5f3c5f4cd68bf25723",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "c63872917723db1d54264e82fd3f553ba01fafeab62afb5f3c5f4cd68bf25723",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "賣掉小水壺，我的心情更不能壓制住。",
      "output_sha256": "aeeebdded2b4b09094128d8aa5c202b2b36f67509917b5685e7d67ca6cd57486",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "aeeebdded2b4b09094128d8aa5c202b2b36f67509917b5685e7d67ca6cd57486",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "不是用的自己的腿似的，到木柈房去看看許多木柈還沒有燒盡，是賣呢？",
      "output_sha256": "2395267a27950f5c8267de4779371533c99b7985278f00f024b02e4085e3c09a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "2395267a27950f5c8267de4779371533c99b7985278f00f024b02e4085e3c09a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "是送朋友？",
      "output_sha256": "69a6bf16a75e01bb4b0ecd86a2082193bca874ceb7f0683906ba05e30be72efb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "69a6bf16a75e01bb4b0ecd86a2082193bca874ceb7f0683906ba05e30be72efb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "門後還有個電爐，還有雙破鞋。",
      "output_sha256": "e56213501e1f87d7f942d0bb1d4c0d736f439349403f6a3cf654cb0f0bbedfb8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "e56213501e1f87d7f942d0bb1d4c0d736f439349403f6a3cf654cb0f0bbedfb8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 18,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "大爐臺上失掉了鍋，失掉了壺，不像個廚房樣。",
      "output_sha256": "ec82e1ecd3098aa5783cc6ba06e939cf73beaad9f82118ab95d6465760a23a5a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "ec82e1ecd3098aa5783cc6ba06e939cf73beaad9f82118ab95d6465760a23a5a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 19,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "一個星期已經過去四天，心情隨着時間更煩亂起來。",
      "output_sha256": "7f46cee5bae7d36d92d6396b131a539b269d7def441c3d7f46346ceec0940f6f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "7f46cee5bae7d36d92d6396b131a539b269d7def441c3d7f46346ceec0940f6f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 19,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "也不能在家燒飯吃，到外面去吃，到朋友家去吃。",
      "output_sha256": "d49284e02ef3ec3036699a9fe29a34ea7ca5d9acfe454cc5a5d9a535b845b5f1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "d49284e02ef3ec3036699a9fe29a34ea7ca5d9acfe454cc5a5d9a535b845b5f1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "看到別人家的小鍋，吃飯也不能安定。",
      "output_sha256": "afc0b2d7cbfdce3806cc119bedb34ca1d32fcc61cc1a78fe03ceb7bdf01a2445",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "afc0b2d7cbfdce3806cc119bedb34ca1d32fcc61cc1a78fe03ceb7bdf01a2445",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "後來，睡覺也變得不安定。",
      "output_sha256": "14d2991a03f9ce839cd3549fed62fa861213b18634aa73b6cb1177edf618f57a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": 0.708947,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        37
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a76edd24eb7f76353713b5454c8d23d63642e41652937f2b7fb24836158f2661"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_ai_sha256": "14d2991a03f9ce839cd3549fed62fa861213b18634aa73b6cb1177edf618f57a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 21,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“明早六點鐘就起來拉床，要早點起來。”",
      "output_sha256": "c34ef291a214ff33e5144a15c3d173bda48f3f1d7992a7b70ee203971580ba9c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": 0.865,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        38
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ff13121490d7cbd2906cb1c51201531ca3d52fe8b48ab166e614742e6397473b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c34ef291a214ff33e5144a15c3d173bda48f3f1d7992a7b70ee203971580ba9c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        37
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 22,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "郎華說這話，覺得走是逼近了！",
      "output_sha256": "0156d6604a4c7aebbe650495fbee6e00dd5bbbe331bc0c20fc1e3fe9f935fc31",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "0156d6604a4c7aebbe650495fbee6e00dd5bbbe331bc0c20fc1e3fe9f935fc31",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 22,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "必定得走了。",
      "output_sha256": "d7c7709a2f271d6db1e86cf9fc4ad0a3a6726b1c13a1776e7ad4c91c0346e926",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "d7c7709a2f271d6db1e86cf9fc4ad0a3a6726b1c13a1776e7ad4c91c0346e926",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 22,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "彷彿若不是郎華提起，我們就不會真的走。",
      "output_sha256": "51c1c58755b0f2b0caeb74a671adaeb4cfb730e579530db18da42c34b61865bf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": 0.351018,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "817031c1cc7159dce50fbaf2c12af81cb5f974bcda071cbd716bb11960571bd4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_ai_sha256": "51c1c58755b0f2b0caeb74a671adaeb4cfb730e579530db18da42c34b61865bf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "夜裡想入眠卻無法安穩。",
      "output_sha256": "f83fecf956ab492f04bc271e7e4241ea0f45e0b997d8341df12e3d0c770127d3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": 0.335,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        42
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "42fead51dcfeae3ca841df6d20c78f09baceae57a40cebca41521d579a981371"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f83fecf956ab492f04bc271e7e4241ea0f45e0b997d8341df12e3d0c770127d3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "太陽尚未升起，鐵門就響了，我心生恐懼，這聲音彷彿要奪去我的心，迷迷糊糊起床。",
      "output_sha256": "f1717f19a8f2bf59a5f385525c0e52345aadd3e6df4e16c5335de4be2f532489",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": 0.513422,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e94e6223a60ab9bc87d7a6fdd16e6f07a169d5fc279e90b88e93c46b213b8a26"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f1717f19a8f2bf59a5f385525c0e52345aadd3e6df4e16c5335de4be2f532489",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "郎華就跳下牀去，兩個人從牀上往下拉着被子、褥子。",
      "output_sha256": "805e4ff69089097d6e0323fa5e7e42555f87f6206435630d636dce480b4df85b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_human_sha256": "805e4ff69089097d6e0323fa5e7e42555f87f6206435630d636dce480b4df85b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "枕頭摔在腳上，忙忙亂亂，有人打着門，院子裏的狗亂咬着。",
      "output_sha256": "2c2ff61ad3dabf50e814a6a50c4cb66ea4f6cf772ef496d5f71edd65be470bf5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_human_sha256": "2c2ff61ad3dabf50e814a6a50c4cb66ea4f6cf772ef496d5f71edd65be470bf5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 24,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "早晨的馬頸鈴聲響起，這樣的早晨已經過去，我們似乎遭遇了厄運，屋子裡空蕩蕩的。",
      "output_sha256": "5b166839b04bfd91ed84384270b1417e1f6f01540892d988cc629c4cc4197ffd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": 0.570438,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        46
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2309fdc5e2d05f3d72e6600cfe8860bd4bb262279cb515f42ea3236cf472b370"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5b166839b04bfd91ed84384270b1417e1f6f01540892d988cc629c4cc4197ffd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 25,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我把行李攤開，就在地板上睡下。",
      "output_sha256": "f45afe07caa10906019b2befb78b1129a3c2b7ba27b954078858451934ca96a7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": 0.636538,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        47
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b9a213516834e45d5559b40d7ee4b58cf9666dacdf3ae0be766883a40a2280fb"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f45afe07caa10906019b2befb78b1129a3c2b7ba27b954078858451934ca96a7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 25,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "爲了多日的病和不安，身體弱的快要支持不住的樣子。",
      "output_sha256": "ff5470fba94d7768adba43802ddb8ddcc6999f2ee08f65935f4516c3689a442f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_human_sha256": "ff5470fba94d7768adba43802ddb8ddcc6999f2ee08f65935f4516c3689a442f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 25,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "郎華跑到江邊去洗他的襯衫，他回來看到我還沒有起來，他就生氣：",
      "output_sha256": "04e915ef01322cf60acf626cf00d68d60f5fb5e6794fbd455c335f685b6f3943",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_human_sha256": "04e915ef01322cf60acf626cf00d68d60f5fb5e6794fbd455c335f685b6f3943",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 26,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“不管什麼時候，總是這麼懶。",
      "output_sha256": "5dc97d79146a36719d2eddf6e4099b100b52931046c2dd5f9c1e8a784311933c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": 0.784545,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        50
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "30bb30743d0f67d43253b16c7cf4f5ed136667bc9c47a91ef8329d3449a37376"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5dc97d79146a36719d2eddf6e4099b100b52931046c2dd5f9c1e8a784311933c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        47
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 26,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "起來，收拾一下，該隨手拿走的東西，先把它拿走。”",
      "output_sha256": "2fa31844eed6705713a9e422b64f97425d858c0ad8a911e7918ee68e5bf738df",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": 0.793022,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        51
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f9e5cb8d5a30828414a4074b5e544507cf678f22981994c5a0403faf614bb31b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2fa31844eed6705713a9e422b64f97425d858c0ad8a911e7918ee68e5bf738df",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        48
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 27,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“有什麼好收拾的，都已經整理好了。",
      "output_sha256": "8a36f904dcb8a15dcdd669fc0a98d11f4cd2b159e33b3b92dda70d0d3b9d227d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": 0.618643,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        52
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "cbb12600ef71508b84da1afca767787286cb0a77e7d8bcd29c8bc2922b6f5022"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8a36f904dcb8a15dcdd669fc0a98d11f4cd2b159e33b3b92dda70d0d3b9d227d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        49
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 27,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我再睡一會，天還早，昨夜我失眠了。”",
      "output_sha256": "de5fed6e8e752e5546a5628b6516e8525ed14524ed1eed4d59a95b627958c46c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 53,
      "source_human_sha256": "de5fed6e8e752e5546a5628b6516e8525ed14524ed1eed4d59a95b627958c46c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 27,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我的腿痛，腰痛，又要犯病的樣子。",
      "output_sha256": "f4f63db88ec8e4664eccabd38faf334e79ec8a9a135fc272536fd381c00cd729",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 54,
      "source_human_sha256": "f4f63db88ec8e4664eccabd38faf334e79ec8a9a135fc272536fd381c00cd729",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 28,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“要睡，收拾乾淨再睡，起來！”",
      "output_sha256": "cd34d2841076e4526ca4d2a0ba0ad4ebb9d4c72919bcef0fc31939398737ac89",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 55,
      "source_human_sha256": "cd34d2841076e4526ca4d2a0ba0ad4ebb9d4c72919bcef0fc31939398737ac89",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 55,
      "paragraph_index": 29,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "鋪在地板上的小行李也捲起來了。",
      "output_sha256": "a60bf7e099f3df8ef55741e0235db071035837d2df8af54abd850911726539f3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 56,
      "source_human_sha256": "a60bf7e099f3df8ef55741e0235db071035837d2df8af54abd850911726539f3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 56,
      "paragraph_index": 29,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "四周的牆壁直直垂下，棚頂上有幾塊微黑的地方，是長時間點蠟燭留下的煙痕。",
      "output_sha256": "7190bcf8d6189b5aa4ecf637377ec4e3869e206cd98c33713bf7ffa5d1267a2f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
      "alignment_score": 0.581783,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        57
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "03a0c45a9ad80657b24fe21777cdfe9308eb94c132c4927104d2d4d1cefe44f0"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 54,
      "source_ai_sha256": "7190bcf8d6189b5aa4ecf637377ec4e3869e206cd98c33713bf7ffa5d1267a2f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        54
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 57,
      "paragraph_index": 29,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "說話的聲音有些轟響。",
      "output_sha256": "d2ea425309062ff629f35c18bdbc0257029a38e523b6e9b8f772a2ccc221588c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 58,
      "source_human_sha256": "d2ea425309062ff629f35c18bdbc0257029a38e523b6e9b8f772a2ccc221588c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 58,
      "paragraph_index": 29,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "空了！",
      "output_sha256": "b03b135aeafbc04f0048d1242b3562125360b801ba30612d6e54ddbac4202b53",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 59,
      "source_human_sha256": "b03b135aeafbc04f0048d1242b3562125360b801ba30612d6e54ddbac4202b53",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 59,
      "paragraph_index": 29,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在屋子裏邊走起來很曠蕩……",
      "output_sha256": "183b64e375f5af4b539db36c297d6302205be5f5ddb3a31d4e42875466b890c3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 60,
      "source_human_sha256": "183b64e375f5af4b539db36c297d6302205be5f5ddb3a31d4e42875466b890c3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 60,
      "paragraph_index": 30,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "最後一次的早餐——麵包和香腸。",
      "output_sha256": "722a70793b0ddff5fc6fdd68979ff530667667f3c6fe195f9243794f8a9febee",
      "alignment_unit_index": 54,
      "alignment_score": 0.567967,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        61
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "781b6a5ba8da714aef6d5bf88852ee7b40b289afe063ca56c519600f47202f25"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 56,
      "source_ai_sha256": "722a70793b0ddff5fc6fdd68979ff530667667f3c6fe195f9243794f8a9febee",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        56
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 61,
      "paragraph_index": 31,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我手提著包袱。",
      "output_sha256": "25dd7dc774de3dee6b87150c37036975636773470d6c8ccb657f7215a563606d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 55,
      "alignment_score": 0.728571,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        62
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2ba0efc6f31a38f3c4e855da0af524b221d4e21d6c18150b487d4abc46b30aaf"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 57,
      "source_ai_sha256": "25dd7dc774de3dee6b87150c37036975636773470d6c8ccb657f7215a563606d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        57
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 62,
      "paragraph_index": 31,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "郎華說：",
      "output_sha256": "1713b870d9c4c79e2870630aab040c89ad92bac817ad3644f0c322a4e7556b27",
      "alignment_unit_index": 56,
      "alignment_score": null,
